	(text "Debug (Rev A) - design notes\n\nJ501: ARM Cortex 10-pin SWD header (2 x 5, 1.27 mm) to the nRF5340 DK debug out (P19) by a 10-pin flat cable.\nPin 3 = GND selects the external target. Voltages must match: run the DK at 3.3 V from P21 (SW10 VEXT->nRF ON,\nSW9 = VDD; DK on USB alone is 3.0 V). Keep DK SB47 open so P19 pin 1 does not drive the badge 3V3.\nVTref = 3V3; nRESET is P0.18/RESET with the nRF52840 internal pull-up once pin reset is enabled; SWO and TDI unused.\nPads: nRESET, SWDIO, SWDCLK, GND. No UART or spare GPIO pads: the E73 module has no free GPIO (DEC-017).\nRear side, reachable with the carrier removed. Nothing on this sheet is measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
